		"description": "<p><em>(1/encounter)</em> <strong>Free action:</strong> You and an ally within Reach 6 both immediately make a weapon/unarmed attack or cast a cantrip for free.</p><hr><p>Level 5 (Master Commander): gain an additional pool of INT uses of Coordinated Strike per Safe Rest (you may still use it only 1/round).</p><p>Levels 9, 13, 17: +1 use of Coordinated Strike.</p><p><em>[A] The encounter use is spent first; from level 5 the Safe Rest pool pays for any further use. Both counters can be corrected on the sheet.</em></p>",
